# Cloudflare Pages security headers for gatte-home.com.
#
# Conservative defaults — tighten over time. CSP rationale:
#   - default-src 'self' = same-origin only baseline
#   - style-src 'unsafe-inline' = Svelte's `style:foo={bar}` attribute
#     emits inline style="..." attributes; without this they're blocked
#   - style-src + font-src whitelist Google Fonts (the one external resource
#     this site loads — see src/app.html)
#   - script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' = SvelteKit emits an inline <script>
#     with hydration JSON per page. 'unsafe-inline' is acceptable here because
#     the 2026-05-17 audit confirmed zero XSS sinks (no {@html}, no innerHTML,
#     no user input rendered, no forms). Tighten later by enabling SvelteKit's
#     kit.csp = { mode: 'hash', directives: { ... } } so the build emits per-
#     page sha256 hashes; switching to header-only CSP would lose frame-
#     ancestors so SvelteKit's meta-tag CSP and this _headers CSP need to
#     stay aligned if you adopt that.
#   - img-src 'self' data: blob: = OG image, generated icons, future blob URLs
#   - media-src 'self' = the home-hub walkthrough.mp4
#   - object-src/base-uri/form-action/frame-ancestors close legacy holes
#
# HSTS with includeSubDomains is the load-bearing one for this site —
# gatte-home.com shares the apex with home-hub.gatte-home.com (the
# apartment-automation Cloudflare Tunnel). includeSubDomains forces that
# subdomain to HTTPS-only too, preventing a protocol-downgrade attack
# from working as a stepping stone into the home-hub API surface.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; media-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
